config BR2_PACKAGE_SDL3_IMAGE
	bool "sdl3_image"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_SDL3
	help
	  SDL3_image is an image file loading library for SDL3. It loads
	  images as SDL surfaces and supports BMP, GIF, JPEG, LBM, PCX,
	  PNG, PNM, QOI, SVG, TGA, TIFF, WEBP, XCF, XPM and XV.

	  Which of the formats that need a helper library are built
	  depends on the image libraries enabled in the Buildroot
	  configuration (jpeg, libpng, tiff, webp, libjxl).

	  https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL_image
